path\\\":\\\"/graph/inferences/3/applications/-\\\",\\\"value\\\":{\\\"input\\\":\\\"M009\\\",\\\"at\\\":\\\"S001\\\",\\\"bindings\\\":\\\"α=ℝⁿ, s=C, μ=Lebesgue, f(x)=K.\\\",\\\"hypothesis_checks\\\":[\\\"The constant K is integrable on C by M008.\\\",\\\"C is measurable because it is compact in Euclidean space.\\\"]}}]}\"}","status":"completed"}}

